'cand_8c8a6ed2680b579d928f956594ce2b9e':'Both same-actor attached hands at unequal torso heights is possible pose material, but the final uses a level, two-sided bowl contact to make setting down legible. An unequal grip would cant the filled vessel and compete with the sill relation. Alternative A retains the coherent paired contact; no height-offset effect retained.',
