'cand_dfc1906f2832572d9f6678c5024d7536':'Folk L03 provides the complete raised wooden sill, bright inside, dark outside and outside-resting bowl relation. Complete alternative A realizes all source clauses with one bowl instead of copying the source’s genre label. A wins because the bowl left on the cold side adds a local, visually testable tension to the interrupted return. Literal final evidence: A raised wooden sill separates a lit interior from the dark exterior; a bowl rests outside the sill. Material inspiration only; native chosen list stays empty and native approval remains false.',
'cand_eaa9eb3628765fc188662cb826ef4e96':'The optional multi-component grain/architecture/exposure bundle requires readable grain, recessed wall-thickness doorway with path and surface-attached service fixtures, and controlled tonal levels. It includes style effects while style is closed; service fixtures and the brighter-window exposure arrangement are not established. No whole bundle retained; practical legibility is independently motivated by the sill task.',
