'cand_505019e27cd555eb8e607ab39486a2d5':'The full subject/reflection comparison needs a mirror boundary, corresponding reflected body and shared alignment marker all in one frame. A mirror is not in the scene and would compete with the doorway’s second space; it offers a different perceptual event. No retained mirror or alignment effect.',
'cand_62b2336d58395b0688f96fd1cc511216':'B02 requires open right hand, fist reflection of that same hand and the entire mirror frame. This impossible mismatch conflicts with frozen surreal=0 added treatment and replaces the grounded customary unease. Body_geometry/subject effects are closed. No admitted alternative or retained mismatch.',
'cand_92cebc296818570eb3ac1adfd9b7fad4':'A calm labeling worker and dominant fictional monstrous prop at the same workstation is a complete threat/work contrast, not an orchard return. The workstation and labeling action would reorganize the photograph beyond local creativity=1 variation and change its event. No retained comic-work contrast.',
'cand_ac9a5babbbe85df685df45d290f469c4':'D11 requires a narrow footpath, thick exposed roots crossing it and a split wooden trail marker leaning beside it. Those exact path/roots/marker owners are absent; placing all three outside would shrink them beneath reliable view scale and turn the orchard into a blocked trail. No retained roots, split marker or curse claim.',
'cand_c0976d9fc3a856319c3c80e268447465':'The complete blank or non-legible diary source has no declared writable effects. A diary is unestablished and would add a second symbolic prop unrelated to the shared bowl. No admitted alternative or retained diary.',
'cand_ddb32fff91b650009fb736b9616bd8df':'The full seasonal pastel hanbok palette is tied to hanbok, not a generic light color. No hanbok is established and changing wool dress to one is outside a color-only effect. No palette laundering or retained hanbok cue.',
'cand_0754e4248862538eb282a8451f28d4d7':'The full hotel coffee-service relation needs small handled cup, its matching saucer, lowering endpoint, handle grip, free second hand, reception table and upholstered seating. Those connected owners would replace the communal bowl scene. No retained cup-service geometry.',
'cand_1d67fbdb6a565ad98db55acaf2da77e1':'The two raised fists, closer elbows, visible eyes and independently resolved capture support form a boxer guard. A guard can express defense, but this source lacks established tripod/timer/photographer prerequisites and displaces the bowl contact without adding evidence of the custom. No admitted alternative or retained fists.',
