n is practical rather than an appeal demonstration.','prompt_evidence':'a loose strand of hair against her cheek and quiet parted lips give her a restrained, intimate presence'},'fetish':{'intensity':0}},'blend':{'emphasis':'sensual_led'},'contextual_review':[],'contextual_comparison':'No contextual axis candidates returned. Baseline and both full alternatives preserve sensual=1 through ordinary warmth, face, hair and wool. Alternative A changes the practical bowl action and viewpoint without adding fetish or surreal treatment; it gives the genre a concrete boundary while retaining intimate presence.'},'embodiment_review':{'review':review},'h_f2_material_decisions':decisions,'composer':'agent'}
