md=['# Composition comparison','Baseline path: '+str((p/'baseline.txt').resolve()),'Baseline SHA256: '+hashlib.sha256(baseline.encode()).hexdigest(),'Creativity=1: compare local changes. Requester invariants are folk-horror test meaning, fictional reference-guided person and reference use; the specific bowl carry, stance and threshold are replaceable authored staging.','## Baseline',baseline,'The held bowl foregrounds the person and makes arrival intuitive, but the continuing custom is mostly carried by waiting torches and ribbon atmosphere. Its light and face hierarchy are strong; the exact reason the return stopped remains broad.','## Alternative A — selected material-inspired authorial photograph',final,'Source L03 CID cand_dfc1906f2832572d9f6678c5024d7536 / RID base / source a4ff4fb1b4d5004b2b778b8f2d3f1712613e7f38f4494c8911cde2502e6d7e43. Action, pose, composition, material and lighting are open. One bowl and the same person are retained. Complete source meaning is tested manually as material inspiration; native_approval=false is unchanged, with native chosen=[], so this is not qualified whole-source adoption. Compared on the same criteria, A gives a concrete reason to inspect the boundary while retaining reference presence and ordinary ritual ambiguity. Its cost is a lower face position and more difficult hand/sill geometry; the planned oblique view addresses these without implying proven pixels.','## Alternative B — unchosen doorway acknowledgement',altB,'Source cand_91edb1947ac05212bc07c92890e036a2 / RID base / source 1690824594e8009f9a232ca04ba169a7352c8d90255e70c7bed87f499a790333. Its complete inside/outside acknowledgement is coherent but more directly conversational; the visitor occupies the very doorway space needed to see the bowl boundary. It improves immediate two-person relationship clarity while reducing the distant waiting custom. A is preferred on distinct event consequence, compositional economy and local source-specific testability.','## Candidate-specific full source reviews']
for cid,why in reasons.items():md+=['### '+cid,why]
md+=['## Bounded semantic self-review','All requester anchors and required assertion evidence are literal. The full final scene keeps one person in the foreground, one bowl, a plausible two-sided contact and grounded winter custom. L03 is the only material influence retained. R02 is exposed but unselected. Native source approval and user acceptance remain separate and are not promoted by this comparison. The saved image must still prove the complete sill, its two sides, the exterior bowl and contact rather than a generic dark doorway.']
